// Character and class level-up skill lists.
// Point CharacterLevelUpSkillEditor.event / ClassLevelUpSkillEditor.event at a label here.
// BYTE pairs are (level, skillID). Level 0xFF means learned on join. End with LevelUpSkillListEnd.
//
ALIGN 4
LynTutorialSkillList:
LevelUpSkill(0xFF, ChargePlusID)
LevelUpSkillListEnd
